                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection Bethpage 5447V Lever with R027 Rose - This solid forged brass leverset has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage Lever features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure. It is available in a wide array of functions so you will be able to find just the right one to suit your needs. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches; and it is designed to conceal a 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled door.",
